## Playbook: refresh

PHASE 0 — Recon & Baseline (Read-Only)
- Establish an evidence-based baseline; output ≤ 200-line digest.

PHASE 1 — Isolate the Anomaly
- Define correctness; create a failing, minimal, reproducible test.

PHASE 2 — Root Cause Analysis
- Hypothesis → Experiment → Evidence → Conclusion loop. Avoid symptom patches.

PHASE 3 — Remediation
- Minimal, precise fix; read-write-reread; update all consumers.

PHASE 4 — Verification & Regression Guard
- Confirm fix via failing test; run broader suites; resolve any new failures.

PHASE 5 — Zero-Trust Self-Audit
- Re-verify state and related workflows.

PHASE 6 — Final Report
- Root Cause, Remediation, Verification Evidence, Final Verdict string.

